NCT05881889.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. Adult;
2. Breast cancer patients undergoing treatment for the first time;
3. Able to understand and sign informed consent;
4. Being able to comply with the intervention.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Minors;
